{"sections":{"section_hero_zya9xz":{"type":"section-hero","blocks":{"heading_eUJzbd":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Slogan","heading_font_size":"heading-x-large","heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_9B7eqN":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Jewelry That Resonates with You<\/strong><\/p>","text_font_size":"body-large"}},"button_V4dGDk":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text":"View products","link":"","button_type":"btn--primary","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false}}},"block_order":["heading_eUJzbd","text_9B7eqN","button_V4dGDk"],"settings":{"image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cat-han-wZZR8Is6Rtk-unsplash.png","link":"","width":"wrapper--full","height":"screen-height-three-quarters","flex_align_desktop":"align--middle-center-desktop","content_width":50,"mobile_height":"screen-height-three-quarters--mobile","flex_align_mobile":"align--middle-center-mobile","color_scheme":"","show_text_background":false,"overlay_opacity":0,"show_overlay_text":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_placeholder":true}},"section_divider_jByDzy":{"type":"section-divider","settings":{"show_line":true,"width":"wrapper--narrow","color_scheme":"","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":16}},"section_double_slider_UnpwYa":{"type":"section-double-slider","blocks":{"text_slide_6pjmWY":{"type":"text-slide","settings":{"subheading":"Introducing","title":"Our Story","heading_font_size":"heading-large","text":"<p>At Agvana, we believe your story deserves to be celebrated. Every piece we create is designed to reflect your journey, capturing the essence of meaningful moments and life’s most treasured memories. Each design embodies the artistry of craftsmanship and the emotional depth of personal experiences, nurturing deep connections between the wearer and the world.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_text":"","button_url":"https:\/\/agvana.com\/pages\/our-story","button_type":"btn--black","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_slide_rDVwDa":{"type":"text-slide","settings":{"subheading":"Introducing","title":"Our Mission","heading_font_size":"heading-large","text":"<p>To create sustainable, emotionally meaningful jewelry that celebrates cultural diversity and emotional storytelling, honoring personal growth and life’s unique journeys.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_type":"btn--primary","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_slide_LgPxhF":{"type":"text-slide","settings":{"subheading":"Introducing","title":"Our Vision","heading_font_size":"heading-large","text":"<p>To craft emotionally resonant, sustainable jewelry that reflects the diverse stories and connections of our global community, creating timeless pieces that nurture both personal relationships and the planet.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_type":"btn--primary","button_size":"","button_style":"btn--solid","show_arrow":false,"heading_tag":"automatic"}}},"block_order":["text_slide_6pjmWY","text_slide_rDVwDa","text_slide_LgPxhF"],"settings":{"image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/caleb-ekeroth-wSBQFWF77lI-unsplash.jpg","image_width":"three-quarters","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":4,"text_alignment":"text-left","layout":"","width":"wrapper--full","height":"screen-height-three-quarters","mobile_height":"screen-height-one-half--mobile","reverse_blocks":false,"color_scheme":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_placeholder":true}},"section_double_Up7KND":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"heading_9jBGCE":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Journey, Connection & Craftsmanship","heading_font_size":"heading-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_A4bEWf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Since its founding in 2017 in New York, Agvana has been redefining the essence of fine jewelry through artistry, sustainability, and emotional resonance. Specializing in lab-grown diamonds, we create jewelry that goes beyond beauty, embedding therapeutic stories into every design to foster meaningful bonds between the wearer and the world.<\/p><p>Every collaboration with diverse artists and cultures transforms Agvana’s jewelry into personal treasures, blending luxury with a commitment to environmental consciousness. Our <em>Treasured<\/em> exhibition highlights Agvana’s belief that jewelry is more than adornment—it is a reflection of one’s journey. Guided by values like <strong>Being Seen<\/strong>, <strong>Individuality<\/strong>, and <strong>Journey<\/strong>, we cherish and transform personal stories into timeless creations that resonate deeply with each individual.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}}},"block_order":["heading_9jBGCE","text_A4bEWf"],"settings":{"image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/19.png","image_width":"one-half","text_alignment":"text-left","layout":"is-reversed","width":"wrapper--full","height":"screen-height-three-quarters","mobile_height":"screen-height-one-half--mobile","reverse_blocks":false,"color_scheme":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_placeholder":true}},"section_double_wPzqgK":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"heading_LVYNHB":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"The Treasured Project","heading_font_size":"heading-large","padding_bottom":16,"heading_tag":"automatic"}},"text_jedPq6":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At Agvana, every piece is designed to celebrate your individuality and create a lasting connection with your most cherished memories.<br\/><br\/>Our Treasured Project transforms personal journeys of healing, growth, and individuality into bespoke jewelry pieces, celebrating life’s milestones and connecting us through shared stories. Discover more here.<\/p>","text_font_size":"body-medium","padding_bottom":16}},"buttons_LpXQki":{"type":"buttons","settings":{"button_text":"Coming Soon",